4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S2bEObqCzhkQ7kNvwHKmVaI&_nc_oc=Adr2B9UBD4Lya5orHmIQEt3R02j5VsQ0kSOOs-maLxwc6diSho08pQcES6eMb2WcczM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLO2AJH9I2I5hpIoBiIJGdseu7_h_OUpxEs9bfaC2kK_A&oe=6AB67154"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s2kCXst_xTEQ7kNvwFEEHhI&_nc_oc=AdqtokA0yBzSQyUKGT0Ue3Njd2zyhy_bsE1q8998NfB16Wm_LmApY_wqGATln5DqM-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ8ZWkZFDwYrOi7OQxVLqR5D_AndqKLQ_z2Lna0Yup0TQ&oe=6AB67632"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4LfYW3YuK_kQ7kNvwGfW2iH&_nc_oc=AdrCtJFSgNVnacvVJG5Ay-Id7PFo-oa-u0XFtTHgrkPWnduXbmhhhZeW5ux5Qh8S1TU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJPkzbBSrTnjG4TnUix79myrJDPa5MLMnqXrQLRKHD77A&oe=6AB683D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p